WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:07.729
First, most software burns needless time and power unpacking text and recalculating answers it already solved.

2
00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:15.371
Second, fingerprint-chained logs and dual-time indexes let any machine replay exact past states without guesswork.

3
00:00:15.711 --> 00:00:22.798
Third, zero-copy memory-mapped lookup stores turn repeated work into sub-microsecond reads under two microjoules.
